stateDiagram-v2
  IDLE --> TACTIC: start signal HIGH (raw read)
  TACTIC --> SEARCH: opening done
  SEARCH --> ATTACK: opponent front (|bearing| <= 15)
  SEARCH --> FLANK: opponent on side (|bearing| > 15)
  ATTACK --> FLANK: opponent slid off center
  FLANK --> ATTACK: re-centered
  ATTACK --> SEARCH: lost >400ms
  FLANK --> SEARCH: lost >400ms
  EVADE --> SEARCH: after escape
  SEARCH --> EVADE
  ATTACK --> EVADE
  FLANK --> EVADE
  TACTIC --> EVADE
  EVADE --> STOP
  TACTIC --> STOP
  SEARCH --> STOP
  ATTACK --> STOP
  FLANK --> STOP
  note right of STOP
    Highest priority: checked before every
    other rule, on every loop. Terminal --
    only a power cycle leaves this state.
  end note
